{"id":"torrey:care-overmuch","source":"torrey","name":"Care, Overmuch","slug":"care-overmuch","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"About earthly things, forbidden — Mt 6:25; Lu 12:22,29; Joh 6:27.","refs":[["Matt",6,25,6,25],["Luke",12,22,12,22],["Luke",12,29,12,29],["John",6,27,6,27]]},{"text":"God’s providential goodness should keep us from — Mt 6:26,28,30; Lu 22:35.","refs":[["Matt",6,26,6,26],["Matt",6,28,6,28],["Matt",6,30,6,30],["Luke",22,35,22,35]]},{"text":"God’s promises should keep us from — Heb 13:5.","refs":[["Heb",13,5,13,5]]},{"text":"Trust in God should free us from — Jer 17:7,8; Da 3:16.","refs":[["Jer",17,7,17,7],["Jer",17,8,17,8],["Dan",3,16,3,16]]},{"text":"Should be cast on God — Ps 37:5; 55:22; Pr 16:3; 1Pe 5:7.","refs":[["Ps",37,5,37,5],["Ps",55,22,55,22],["Prov",16,3,16,3],["1Pet",5,7,5,7]]},{"text":"An obstruction to the Gospel — Mt 13:22; Lu 8:14; 14:18-20.","refs":[["Matt",13,22,13,22],["Luke",8,14,8,14],["Luke",14,18,14,20]]},{"text":"Be without — 1Co 7:32; Php 4:6.","refs":[["1Cor",7,32,7,32],["Phil",4,6,4,6]]},{"text":"Unbecoming in saints — 2Ti 2:4.","refs":[["2Tim",2,4,2,4]]},{"text":"Uselessness of — Mt 6:27; Lu 12:25,26.","refs":[["Matt",6,27,6,27],["Luke",12,25,12,25],["Luke",12,26,12,26]]},{"text":"Vanity of — Ps 39:6; Ec 4:8.","refs":[["Ps",39,6,39,6],["Eccl",4,8,4,8]]},{"text":"Warning against — Lu 21:34.","refs":[["Luke",21,34,21,34]]},{"text":"Sent as a punishment to the wicked — Eze 4:16; 12:19.","refs":[["Ezek",4,16,4,16],["Ezek",12,19,12,19]]},{"text":"Martha. — Lu 10:41.","refs":[["Luke",10,41,10,41]]},{"text":"Persons who offered to follow Christ. — Lu 9:57.","refs":[["Luke",9,57,9,57]]}],"refCount":32}
